[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tRpwbknxJuA&t=1180s%22 Youtube Time Stamp]

* '''Mod Arcane:''' The Nihil Shard's only use is the Crossbow and the potions. The potions don't have really high demand, so I think it's fine.
* '''Mod Arcane:''' You got very, very lucky. Congratulations - I guess this is your punishment for being lucky (having to do the content more to make your crossbow). If you start doing it in smaller groups I think you'll find that you get more Nihil Shards. It's just because it's dividing amongst many players so you're just getting one in bigger groups.

