==Question #25==
{{Cquote2|How are the boss mechanics for Nex different from pre-EoC RS2 or even RS3?}}

[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tRpwbknxJuA&t=3440s Youtube Time Stamp]

* '''Mod Kieren:''' There are lots of small changes. We don't have every feature of the full RuneScape engine, so the way Nex is coded is different. We are very much paying attention to past behaviour but sometimes we'd acknowledge small changes needed to be made either because it needed it or we didn't like the original design.
* '''Mod Kieren:''' Just before EOC (mid-2012), Nex was updated to use prayers and reflect curses in the first four phase so that you'd need to switch up between ranged and melee. We didn't want that and we wanted to stay true to the 2011 Nex. it's recognizably similar to that version even though we've made few tweaks. The way that the prison works is slightly different in the ice phase for instance. Also, the way she jumps is slightly different to the original because she never jumped next to you, but she does now.
* '''Mod Kieren:''' The biggest change of all is balancing because we couldn't just put 2011 Nex in the game with the same stats, damage output, accuracy that they had back in 2011 when players had summoning and overloads. We have other things but a player Old School today is not as powerful as they were in 2011, nor do they have the same staying power in terms of supplies so we had to balance Nex differently.

